    {
      "key": "dxf-viewer.limits",
      "source": "Supported preview and export: LINE, CIRCLE, ARC, and straight LWPOLYLINE/POLYLINE in the XY plane. Bulged curves, text, blocks, dimensions, splines, 3D entities and other types are listed as unsupported and are not included in measurements or exports. Maximum file size: 10 MB; maximum group records: 200,000.",
      "source_hash": "783499d44597e45c05459c343fa5c7306eef0bfd3407a5b1c5badb793bf136ce",
      "context": "limits",
      "translation": "预览和导出支持 XY 平面中的 LINE、CIRCLE、ARC 和直线段 LWPOLYLINE/POLYLINE。带凸度的曲线、文字、块、标注、样条曲线、3D 实体及其他类型会列为不支持，不计入测量，也不会导出。文件最大 10 MB；组码记录最多 200,000 条。",
      "old_record_id": "8a19a095c87188e1ba81c33a6855a37869e38367e039e08f0a8e907774471bbb",
      "old_translation_hash": "f878856427d5b2aae5eba992d03616d2f98de0b464779c48bf7e671dd87c7aad",
      "origin": "direct-agent-correction",
      "legacy_record_id": null,
      "native_review": false
    },
    {
      "key": "dxf-viewer.privacy",
      "source": "The file is read in this browser and is not uploaded. Only basic 2D lines, circles, arcs and straight-segment polylines are drawn; unsupported entities are listed and excluded from measurements and export.",
      "source_hash": "83d9effeb10db2cfc8b9ec4a67f2cac9e9ad08a27e76b5ab9fd4ce3ae5c17ab1",
      "context": "privacy",
      "translation": "文件在此浏览器中读取，不会上传。只绘制基本的 2D 线段、圆、圆弧和直线段多段线；不支持的实体会列出，并排除在测量和导出之外。",
      "old_record_id": "25a97ceac28ddd3309de36c4ef726b5a313d7666ef1c9e92cf2fc6b809ccbb5a",
      "old_translation_hash": "1de7c6845d526c202bdadf695076a62399f0c3bf05ede20e5269381a90dfeb97",
      "origin": "direct-agent-correction",
      "legacy_record_id": null,
      "native_review": false
    },
    {
      "key": "shikaku.description",
      "source": "Play Shikaku online for free. Divide each grid into rectangles that match the numbered areas. Get a daily puzzle, hints and a fresh board; your game stays on this device.",
      "source_hash": "e418413f1c809ce33c6f17e66f10484724abb9b24447be9218f95a69cbcaa3ba",
      "context": "description",
      "translation": "免费在线玩Shikaku。将每个网格划分为与编号区域匹配的矩形。获取每日谜题、提示和新棋盘；您的游戏将保留在此设备上。",
      "old_record_id": "ce2de3faefe25e02ca5882f0cb7092f18ffa3393c7616ed69dfd21b03bb4fbf8",
