    {
      "key": "shikaku.fields.faq.0.a",
      "source": "Shikaku is a number puzzle. Draw rectangles around the clues. Each rectangle has the area shown by its clue, and all grid squares must be used once.",
      "source_hash": "1da9eab3e79e5ba1c578b590065014537d077420ad02d77072da8a8f5d7355b5",
      "context": "fields.faq.0.a",
      "translation": "Shikaku 是一款数字拼图。在线索周围画出矩形。每个矩形都有其线索所显示的面积，并且所有网格方块必须使用一次。",
      "old_record_id": "7c7407e706369758b492626a727e9ece6db7eec37b5e3884b58a137eb3a4f5e7",
      "old_translation_hash": "cee98e537958c9eaba026d53b68db4e339eddf9b7683d99528d5d615f40540eb",
