      "key": "voice-changer.description",
      "source": "Change pitch, shape radio or deep-voice effects, preview echo, and export processed audio locally. Free, private, and no upload.",
      "source_hash": "9c82271bcbd243fd5ec78c1f86281aad2b110f9d14589729fda7cf9fec1e0f41",
      "context": "description",
      "translation": "更改音高，添加收音机或低沉人声效果，试听回声，并在本地导出处理后的音频。免费、保护隐私，无需上传。",
