    {
      "key": "voice-changer.details",
      "source": "Your browser decodes the selected audio, applies Web Audio filters, gain, pitch-rate and optional echo locally, then renders a WAV file for download. No audio is sent to a server.",
      "source_hash": "771da556d0ed6f331adfc2e9f36149cb2e9756c81d7735fd2e47345e4259664c",
      "context": "details",
      "translation": "浏览器在本地解码所选音频，应用 Web Audio 滤波器、增益、音高与播放速率调整以及可选回声，然后生成可下载的 WAV 文件。音频不会发送到服务器。",
      "old_record_id": "f1e22d67c2153015803c4dcf524b33baeaec80e722de832f3e1ac2a8024978d5",
      "old_translation_hash": "2d2f96f4c4f2ea9d76a72361906470bbe0c4457b7e5ecb00fc6eb27d8a5b62a6",
      "origin": "direct-agent-correction",
      "legacy_record_id": null,
      "native_review": false
    },
    {
      "key": "voice-changer.example",
      "source": "Try a voice recording and compare the original with the radio or lower-pitch preset. Pitch changes also change playback speed; this is not voice cloning or studio-grade pitch correction.",
      "source_hash": "2b449479c7ae7143ead7f8a406c6e238d202e1bd82421d6276ef8ef3eeb6f4c3",
      "context": "example",
      "translation": "试用人声录音，将原声与收音机效果或较低音高预设作比较。改变音高也会改变播放速度；这不是声音克隆，也不是录音室级的音高校正。",
      "old_record_id": "db96a97ee3beacde9f8fd292f4f96c4b1e742aec86c1c144dbacf89d03ac4783",
