      "key": "voice-changer.faq.4.a",
      "source": "Audio rendering uses your device memory and processor. Short clips and a computer usually work more smoothly than long clips on a phone.",
      "source_hash": "8e137b897ab5662ed60a6cd5e3a8197e40040508cf5becbad56f41f71e8f0052",
      "context": "faq.4.a",
      "translation": "音频渲染会使用设备的内存和处理器。与在手机上处理长片段相比，在电脑上处理短片段通常更流畅。",
