    {
      "key": "voice-changer.limits",
      "source": "This lightweight tool is designed for short clips, not full-length songs. Pitch is changed by adjusting playback rate, so the clip duration and voice tone change together. Effects cannot create a natural new identity, separate voices, or guarantee the same result on every browser.",
      "source_hash": "72eaa6afc178fd8d0e8f7da5c73ba70e6a5473c00316ce0df573d3b309416522",
      "context": "limits",
      "translation": "此轻量工具用于处理短音频片段，而不是完整歌曲。音高通过改变播放速率来调整，因此片段时长和声音音色会一起改变。这些音效无法让声音自然地变成其他人的声音，也无法分离人声或保证在每个浏览器中都得到相同结果。",
      "old_record_id": "064c8fb0caf3da2283544153c1adbf40d73b441aabb1760d1fb668eba9a4b3fc",
      "old_translation_hash": "1df581d2e7beabe5d9d3dd8906a8a0a26088d1cd6b3b68f024b0d1ea9bc7e8bb",
